          </costs>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Death Company" id="de1a-b438-fa66-f915" hidden="false">
              <description>The Chaplain is always accompanied by D3+3 Death Company Space Marines. If the Death Company are equipped with jump packs, then the Chaplain must also have a jump pack.</description>
