    <selectionEntry id="052c-59f6-c4f4-fba1-29754" name="&quot;Stormraven Squadron&quot;" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade">
      <profiles />
      <rules>
        <rule id="2a59-beb3-9f3c-d742-29754" name="Annihilation Strike" page="115" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>Once per battle, at the start of your turn, pick an enemy unit anywhere on the board to be the target. Any Stormraven Gunships from this Formation that are within 72" of the target and have line of sight to it must fire all of their remaining stormstrike missiles at it, as though it were the shooting phase. Units that perform this attack may shoot again in the shooting phase and do not count the missiles they used against the number of attack they may make.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <constraints />
      <selectionEntries />
      <selectionEntryGroups>
