    <selectionEntry id="cb4c08b8-78fe-b09a-cf59-883cd7e4cf59-29754" name="Warlord" page="0" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade">
      <profiles />
      <rules>
        <rule id="155c06d4-b7d7-88b0-af4c-63831a642023-29754" name="Warlord" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
        <description>If Thulsa Kane is part of an army then he will always be the army's Warlord, regardless of the Leadership value of other HQ choices. He does not roll on the Warlord Traits table, but instead receives the following unique Warlord trait:

• The Wrath of Old Night: During any Assault phase in which Thulsa Kane is fighting a challenge, all friendly units with Chapter Tactics (Executioners) gain a +1 bonus to their score for working out the victor in assaults and +1 to their Sweeping Advance.</description></rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <constraints>
        <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="0.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="cb4c08b8-78fe-b09a-cf59-883cd7e4cf59-minSelections-29754" type="min" />
        <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="cb4c08b8-78fe-b09a-cf59-883cd7e4cf59-maxSelections-29754" type="max" />
        <constraint field="selections" scope="roster" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" id="cb4c08b8-78fe-b09a-cf59-883cd7e4cf59-maxInRoster-29754" type="max" />
      </constraints>
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry id="810c7979-8467-7a54-7e27-98668cae6737-29754" name="Apocalypse" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <constraints>
            <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="810c7979-8467-7a54-7e27-98668cae6737-maxSelections-29754" type="max" />
          </constraints>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry id="94ed77ef-0925-fa31-98a9-78aa39956a93-29754" name="Finest Hour" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade">
              <profiles>
                <profile id="287dfa25-ae5a-c2ae-7baa-b8d094b88b3e-29754" name="Sons of the Primarch: Blood Angels" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82">
                  <profiles />
                  <rules />
                  <infoLinks />
                  <modifiers />
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Flying Monstrous Creature</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <rules>
                <rule id="5d661e70-63cb-9465-f89f-c98e39f16bb2-29754" name="Finest Hour" hidden="false">
                  <profiles />
                  <rules />
                  <infoLinks />
                  <modifiers />
                  <description>Once per game, at the start of any of their turns, a player may choose to take his Warlord's Finest Hour. The warlord has a 3++ and Eternal Warrior and is allowed to order an All-out Attack. Furthermore you may roll on the Exemplar Tables or use the Sons of the Primarch-rule. These effects last until the Warlord's next turn.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <infoLinks />
              <modifiers />
              <constraints>
                <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="94ed77ef-0925-fa31-98a9-78aa39956a93-minSelections-29754" type="min" />
                <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="94ed77ef-0925-fa31-98a9-78aa39956a93-maxSelections-29754" type="max" />
              </constraints>
              <selectionEntries />
              <selectionEntryGroups />
              <entryLinks />
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" value="0.0" typeId="6f18-a8fc-2c5b-9517" />
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="62d84aad-e5c1-a3ab-70a9-b0aa8f04ea33-29754" name="Divine Intervention" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade">
              <profiles />
              <rules>
                <rule id="913f9f96-6519-1c20-2e98-bf38e40c2602-29754" name="For The Emperor!" hidden="false">
                  <profiles />
                  <rules />
                  <infoLinks />
                  <modifiers />
                  <description>If at least half the units in your army have been removed as casualties, you may invoke Divine Intervention. Untill end of turn, all units from the Blood Angel-Faction have Furious Charge and Fearless. Use this power only once per game.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <infoLinks />
              <modifiers />
              <constraints>
                <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="62d84aad-e5c1-a3ab-70a9-b0aa8f04ea33-minSelections-29754" type="min" />
