          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>All Troops units from this Formation have the Objective Secured special rule. A unit with this special rule controls objectives even if an enemy scoring unit is within range of the Objective Marker, unless the enemy unit also has this special rule.</description>
