        <rule id="780c839c-5e9a-7142-46ab-81f518bb457a-29754" name="Power of the Machine Spirit" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
        <description>A Land Raider can fire one more weapon than would normally be permitted. In addition, this weapon can be fired at a different target unit to any other weapons, subject to the normal rules for shooting.


Therefore, a Land Raider that has moved at combat speed can fire two weapons, and a Land Raider that has either moved at cruising speed, or has suffered a 'crew stunned' or 'crew shaken' result can fire a single weapon.</description></rule>
      </rules>
