        <selectionEntry id="363664f7-d0c1-de99-715f-67d66f9323b3-29754" name="The Defenders of the Cathedrum" hidden="false" collective="false" type="unit">
          <profiles />
          <rules>
            <rule id="37f6c7f2-5eef-884b-2048-6fcd3a3a02a2-29754" name="Stubborn" hidden="false">
              <profiles />
              <rules />
              <infoLinks />
              <modifiers />
            <description>When taking Morale tests, stubborn units always ignore any negative Leadership modifiers. Independent characters that are stubborn confer the ability onto any unit that they join.</description></rule>
            <rule id="803b0a0d-72c8-50c9-3204-ca4743119c32-29754" name="Counter-attack" hidden="false">
              <profiles />
              <rules />
              <infoLinks />
              <modifiers />
            <description>When a unit with this rule is assaulted by the enemy it must take a Leadership test. If the test is successful all models in the unit get the +1 assault bonus to their attacks, exactly as if they too had assaulted that turn.


This rule cannot be used if, when assaulted, the unit was already locked in combat from a previous turn.</description></rule>
          </rules>
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <constraints />
          <selectionEntries />
          <selectionEntryGroups>
            <selectionEntryGroup id="a414a397-0518-4333-f9d1-65ac56f2310e-29754" name="Terminator Squad" hidden="false" collective="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="9b55e8e1-d31b-b78c-073e-a905609e51a3-29754">
